      "text": "κυρία ἐκκλησία There was a ‘sovereign’ assembly once a month unless additional emergency ones were needed. κύριος is a word with a wide range of meanings, all of which are concerned with authority or power. The head of the family is ὁ κύριος, and the word is also used in the New Testament for Jesus Christ.",
